    "Apple Translation 在本机处理；你启用的有道、Google 或 DeepL 会收到待翻译原文。翻译历史仅保留到本次退出。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Translation runs on this Mac. Youdao, Google, or DeepL receive source text when enabled. Translation history is kept only until quit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Translation 在本机处理；你启用的有道、Google 或 DeepL 会收到待翻译原文。翻译历史仅保留到本次退出。"
